# WFORMTI.KEY - Enter against Ctrl-Enter in the memo; TEST/GOLDEN/WIN/WFORMTI.SNP.
# Ctrl-Enter starts a new line, Enter is OK.
K F5
T A
K TAB TAB TAB TAB TAB TAB TAB DOWN
K CTRL-TAB
S MEMO
K CEND CTRL-ENTER
T Z
S CTRLENT
# Enter is OK: the dialog ends, the memo text is kept by memo_save.
K ENTER
S SAVED
K F5
S REOPEN
# A line over MEMO_COLS characters fails OK at the memo.
K CTRL-TAB CEND
T 0123456789012345678901234567890123456789012345678901234567890123456789
K ENTER
S LONG
K ESC
S ASK
K Y
S END
